  "headline": "Death Stranding 2: On the Beach lands on PC March 19 with ultrawide support",
  "description": "Kojima Productions confirmed Death Stranding 2: On the Beach launches on PC March 19, 2026. The port highlights ultrawide resolutions, 4K output, keyboard and mouse support, and DualSense features.",
  "articleBody": "Kojima Productions announced that Death Stranding 2: On the Beach is coming to PC on March 19, 2026. PlayStation.Blog lists Steam and the Epic Games Store as storefronts, framing the release as a feature-rich PC-focused port.\n\nThe PC version supports 21:9 and 32:9 ultrawide display modes alongside 4K output. Players can use keyboard and mouse controls, while those who connect a DualSense controller will get haptic feedback and adaptive trigger features.\n\nAudio options include Dolby Atmos plus DTS Sound Unbound and Windows Sonic. The announcement also notes PlayStation account linkage bonuses and teases new modes and additional content arriving on the same day for both PC and PS5.",
